	<string id="ui_mcm_menu_dogma_game_weapons_ban">
		<text>Weapons Ban</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_game_weapons_ban_page_description">
		<text>Traders won't buy your guns, ammo, or attachments - you must find them in stashes and corpses. Ammo crafting: 1 casing + 1 bullet per round; powder is an integer multiple of 1:1 from vanilla (e.g. ~2.7/rd becomes 3). Corpse/stash ammo still uses RU budgets converted by box price. New-game extra ammo is a flat box count per gun on top of the loadout grant. Stash attach extras use price bands below.</text>
	</string>

	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_game_weapons_ban_extra_start_ammo_boxes">
		<text>Extra start ammo (boxes per weapon)</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_game_weapons_ban_extra_start_ammo_boxes_desc">
		<text>Added on top of the loadout's usual ammo (typically 2 boxes). Box size is unchanged. 0 disables the extra grant. Default 5.</text>
	</string>

